BND-13: apply the Qmax capture limit to custom inlets with a RATING curve

Same fix as for 5.3.0 in Inlet.cpp getCustomCapturedFlow(): the RATING branch
ignored qMax. Limit the capture to num_inlets * qMax.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply BND-13_swmm600.patch

diff --git a/src/engine/hydraulics/Inlet.cpp b/src/engine/hydraulics/Inlet.cpp
index 2738ce5..b698e99 100644
--- a/src/engine/hydraulics/Inlet.cpp
+++ b/src/engine/hydraulics/Inlet.cpp
@@ -557,6 +557,7 @@ double getCustomCapturedFlow(const UsageParams& u, const Geom& g,
         // --- curve is captured flow v. downstream node depth
         qCaptured = u.num_inlets * u.clog_factor *
             table_lookupEx(curve, depth * ucf_len) / ucf_flow;
+        qCaptured = std::min(qCaptured, u.num_inlets * qMax);
     }
     return qCaptured * sides;
 }
